  nonce: '7526'  # 7526
  message: "Done in PR #3486. Per the (a)-option scope expansion: full IPC family producer migration in one PR. 9 production emit sites across 6 linkers folded per ADR-0026's rename table (ipc_calls→calls+protocol=ipc; ipc_event/message_send/websocket_message/message_queue→event_publishes+channel_kind in {ipc,websocket,queue}; websocket_connection→references+construct=websocket_endpoint). message_receive emits dropped per the DEPRECATE-NO-FOLD verdict (forward event_publishes captures the relationship; slice handles reverse traversal natively). Consumer-side update: io_boundary._TRACEABLE_EDGE_TYPES + tag_io_boundaries call_types both add 'event_publishes' so I/O-boundary tracing keeps crossing async-channel boundaries. 3353 tests passing, 100% coverage on all 6 changed source files. Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation: IPC/WebSocket/MQ-heavy repos (Tauri, Electron, Phoenix LiveView, RabbitMQ, Kafka) should see the centrality/slice/sketch implications confirmed by a DEEP cycle."  # 7526
